This is possible under Linux too; see the Access Howto under "Making the
keyboard behave"
(http://sunsite.unc.edu/mdw/HOWTO/Access-HOWTO-5.html#ss5.3) and the
Keyboard and Console HowTo under "I can use only one finger to type with"
