    Erik,

    According to my AS200 4/233 manual, the final LED
code indicates that there is a memory problem
(MEMROY TEST 1 FAILURE).  You are not exiting the POST,
therefore the FLASH doesn't come into the picture with this
problem.  (POST is not in FLASH).  Try re-seating the SIMMS.

There is a slim chance that the error codes are different on
the two machines . . . Doubtful though.

                Hope this helps,
                            Keith Hayes






