> is it possible to install Linux on an

> 	DECstation 3000 AXP 300 ?

According to _Alpha Implementations and Architecture_ this machine has
a Turbochannel bus.  Linux/Alpha does not currently support this bus,
so the answer is no, unless you are into writing your own drivers...

If you are just looking for free unix, NetBSD (www.netbsd.org) will
run on this machine.






