> u = Floating point exception (core dumped)
> [cliff@van cliff]$ eg++ hello.c++ -g -o hello   <-- using
> egcs 1.0.1
> [cliff@van cliff]$ ./hello
> hello
> u = 2.38723e-314 M_PI = 3.14159
> u * M_PI = Floating point exception (core dumped)
> 
> slightly different results, but both hosed.
